direction: right
packages: "Declared package pins\ngerbil.pkg -> Core -> inherited POO"
install: "Native gerbil deps --install\nfail-fast /no retry fallback"
compiler: "Package-owned compilation\n2 workers /2GiB parent +child compiler\nCore retains300s /Parser has no180s cap"
index: "Native gxpkg final retag\ngxtags default Emacs format +native heap default\nnonempty output required /no registry edits"
products: "Native lib +static +test-lib\nactual compiler +source +ABI association"
abi: "Shared ABI build owner\nreuse compiler host initialization\nstd/make pkg-config-libs for OpenSSL"
tests: "Core TestingScript -> Gerbil Harness\n3GiB /900s /actual Case +MODULE-OK records"
transport: "Current-run/platform artifact\nnative tar /no custom admission"
restore: "New-process native consumers\nno compile fallback\nCore independently checks currentness and approvals"
controls: "Negative controls\nsource/output/approval refusal\ninstallation failure remains failure"
old: "Historical green c3e3dc91\nrelocation-only GAMBOPT\nnot a2GiB index acceptance receipt"
regression: "44c61d6e expanded compiler cap globally\nGC-live growth exceeded2GiB during tagging\napproved correction restores the original scope"
packages -> install
install -> compiler -> products
install -> index
products -> abi -> tests
products -> transport -> restore -> tests
controls -> tests
old -> regression -> index

standalone: "OPEN /exact macOS CI archive\nIndependent two-form source: standalone SKIP, module TAG\nNo replacement launcher /no SDK edit"
index -> standalone
